{"unit_id":"imtanhui__dsh-plugin-butler#feature-1","repo":"imtanhui/dsh-plugin-butler","commit":"12a99276590824eb2c480e92a197e596e2e00afe","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-butler 的功能「插件目录与状态」：插件管理页按官方与外部类别列出 profile 插件，显示启用状态、加载失败和注入依赖；可搜索名称或说明。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:419-478","lib/client.js:1030-1095"]}
{"unit_id":"imtanhui__dsh-plugin-butler#feature-2","repo":"imtanhui/dsh-plugin-butler","commit":"12a99276590824eb2c480e92a197e596e2e00afe","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-butler 的功能「启停插件」：用户点击插件开关后，Host 精确修改 profile 的 cordis.patch.yml；可管理的插件由 DSH HMR 观察器热应用，系统项及表达式控制项不能从界面切换。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:485-533","lib/patch.js:45-83"]}
{"unit_id":"imtanhui__dsh-plugin-butler#feature-3","repo":"imtanhui/dsh-plugin-butler","commit":"12a99276590824eb2c480e92a197e596e2e00afe","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-butler 的功能「自定义分组和说明」：用户可编辑插件目录说明，并为外部插件创建、重命名、删除和分配分组；覆盖内容保存到本地 JSON 文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:535-674","lib/client.js:264-349"]}
{"unit_id":"imtanhui__dsh-plugin-butler#feature-4","repo":"imtanhui/dsh-plugin-butler","commit":"12a99276590824eb2c480e92a197e596e2e00afe","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-butler 的功能「更新与插件市场」：页面可检查 npm registry 最新版本并更新，也可搜索 GitHub 的 dsh-plugin 仓库、查看详情并安装或卸载插件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:680-714","lib/index.js:770-879","lib/index.js:902-970"]}
{"unit_id":"imtanhui__dsh-plugin-butler#feature-5","repo":"imtanhui/dsh-plugin-butler","commit":"12a99276590824eb2c480e92a197e596e2e00afe","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-butler 的功能「依赖关系图」：依赖图把运行时插件及服务注入关系可视化，支持拖动节点、悬停查看信息和聚焦依赖链。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:419-478","lib/client.js:790-900"]}
{"unit_id":"imtanhui__dsh-plugin-butler#caveat-1","repo":"imtanhui/dsh-plugin-butler","commit":"12a99276590824eb2c480e92a197e596e2e00afe","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-butler 使用前须知：市场搜索会向 api.github.com 发送搜索词，并受 GitHub Search API 访问限制；npm 版本查询会请求 registry.npmjs.org。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:770-783","lib/index.js:270-280"]}
